{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "母骨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嗣法於師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雄藏主"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "住京師南禪寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "住豐州萬壽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "住常州法雲禪寺，號復庵，法嗣于師。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法嗣于師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "住京師真如禪寺，號古先，法嗣於師。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "住京師真如禪寺，後號明叟，嗣師。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "病中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因受戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因受戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "住南禪禪寺，法嗣于師。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "住京師萬壽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一百八首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "右懷淨土詩者，中峯和上之所作也。詩凡一百八首，\n取素珠之一周也。予甞為書其全稿矣，茲特采其要\n者，再為書之。憫群生之迷塗，道佛境之極樂，及其成\n功一也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大德五年春三月戊申，　弟子趙孟頫書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上數語，子昂親書石刻法帖之䟦語也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛法金湯編十六云：孟頫字子昂，興人云云。懷淨\n土詩䟦亦具載之。可見初書全編百八首，後撰其\n要五十八首書之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄淵"}
{"id": null, "n": "0719001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0719001", "type": "orig", "text": "盡疑𦘕"}
{"id": null, "n": "0743001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0743001", "type": "orig", "text": "其下疑脫心字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0744001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0744001", "type": "orig", "text": "中峯次魯菴懷淨土韻脚十首詩見中峯廣錄二十八尤精要也可覽"}
{"id": null, "n": "0744002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0744002", "type": "orig", "text": "紅一作金"}
{"id": null, "n": "0744003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0744003", "type": "orig", "text": "千百一作百千"}
{"id": null, "n": "0744004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0744004", "type": "orig", "text": "月一作日"}
{"id": null, "n": "0745001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0745001", "type": "orig", "text": "貪一作耽"}
{"id": null, "n": "0745002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0745002", "type": "orig", "text": "目一作自"}
{"id": null, "n": "0745003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0745003", "type": "orig", "text": "＊着痛一作痛着（＊印ノ字ハ本文ト異ナル。󴦒）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0745004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0745004", "type": "orig", "text": "春一作正"}
{"id": null, "n": "0745005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0745005", "type": "orig", "text": "面一作向"}
{"id": null, "n": "0745006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0745006", "type": "orig", "text": "傘一作繖"}
{"id": null, "n": "0745007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0745007", "type": "orig", "text": "更一作政"}
{"id": null, "n": "0746001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0746001", "type": "orig", "text": "數一作素"}
{"id": null, "n": "0746002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0746002", "type": "orig", "text": "重一作直"}
{"id": null, "n": "0746003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0746003", "type": "orig", "text": "移作沈"}
